  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"46 equals 2 x plus 2 y\"><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math> gives the perimeter of a rectangular rug that has length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>, in feet, and width <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>, in feet. The width of the rug is <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> feet. What is the length, in feet, of the rug?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
