  ],
  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math>. It's given that the equation <math alttext=\"46 equals 2 x plus 2 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>46</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> gives the perimeter of a rectangular rug that has length <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, in feet, and width <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math>, in feet. It's also given that the width of the rug is <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> feet. Substituting <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> in the equation <math alttext=\"46 equals 2 x plus 2 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>46</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"46 equals 2 x plus 2 left parenthesis 8 right parenthesis\"><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"46 equals 2 x plus 16\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>46</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>16</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn>\n</math> from both sides of this equation yields <math alttext=\"30 equals 2 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>30</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"15 equals x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>15</mn>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Since <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> represents the length, in feet, of the rug, it follows that the length of the rug is <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math> feet.</p>",
